  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1284614-grimoire-of-gaia-3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ohil143.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"256\"></em></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>简介</strong></h4>\n<p>我制作这个模组是为了让《我的世界》继续保持挑战性，并提供更独特的游戏体验。由于我在编程增强型AI或装备方面的技能有限，我打算通过这个模组添加敌对生物以增加游戏难度，而功能强大且编写精良的模组将能为玩家提供高端增强。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组<strong>不</strong>适合新手使用。<em>经验丰富的玩家</em>寻求挑战时或在游戏后期使用效果最佳。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>模组兼容性 (1.12.2)</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>本模组的已添加兼容性的模组；</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baubles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Baubles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thaumcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘工艺</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">足够多的物品 (JEI)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>已为本模组添加兼容性的模组；</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ancient-warfare-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">远古战争 2</a><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/headcrumbs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Headcrumbs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/universalbestiary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">通用图鉴</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>信息</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fthe-grimoire-of-gaia.wikia.com%252fwiki%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AmGNFYG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">官方维基：<strong><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fthe-grimoire-of-gaia.wikia.com%252fwiki%252fThe_Grimoire_of_Gaia_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a></em></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;Minecraft论坛主题：<em><strong> <a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/1284614-grimoire-of-gaia-2-1-8-2c-mobs-monsters-monster\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接</a></strong></em>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">加入我们的Discord：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscordapp.com%252finvite%252fpGu5afh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8JhuB3m.png\" alt=\"Grimoire of Gaia Discord\" width=\"250\" height=\"85\"></strong></em></a></p>",
